{"id":"3e87bcedc6718afa","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-closed-class-measure.md","title":"可计算树的层测度递减逼近","display":"thm-closed-class-measure — 可计算树的层测度递减逼近","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-closed-class-measure","aliases":["20-thm-closed-class-measure"],"display":"thm-closed-class-measure — 可计算树的层测度递减逼近","chapter":"11","section":"11.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 11.3.1 的 Aₙ 构造","source_printed_pages":[191],"source_pdf_pages":[222],"depends_on":["[[20-df-tree]]","[[20-df-cantor-measure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-closed-class-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-closed-class-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-closed-class-measure — 可计算树的层测度递减逼近"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"section","html":"11.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 11.3.1 的 Aₙ 构造"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>191</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>222</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"978bb51599bc5702\" href=\"?note=978bb51599bc5702\" title=\"20-df-cantor-measure\">20-df-cantor-measure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 可计算树；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=[T]\">\\(C=[T]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_T(n)=2^{-n}|T\\cap2^n|\">\\(q_T(n)=2^{-n}|T\\cap2^n|\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"978bb51599bc5702\" href=\"?note=978bb51599bc5702\" title=\"20-df-cantor-measure\">20-df-cantor-measure</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}closed-class-measure}\\vdash\nq_T(n+1)\\le q_T(n),\\qquad\\mu(C)=\\inf_n q_T(n)=\\lim_n q_T(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}closed-class-measure}\\vdash\nq_T(n+1)\\le q_T(n),\\qquad\\mu(C)=\\inf_n q_T(n)=\\lim_n q_T(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每层柱的有限不交并 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_n\">\\(V_n\\)</span> 有可计算有理测度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_T(n)\">\\(q_T(n)\\)</span>；树的向下闭合使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_{n+1}\\subseteq V_n\">\\(V_{n+1}\\subseteq V_n\\)</span>，交恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>。概率测度对递减序列连续，所以给出极限。因而有效闭类的测度可从上方作可计算有理逼近，不能据此断言极限可计算。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 11.3.1 的 Aₙ 构造；印刷页 191；PDF 第 222 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-measure","status":"resolved","id":"978bb51599bc5702","anchor":"